From 6c3b0d7a5f012c8a8c24bdfd24ce092a6dbe0ec4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tanmay Varun <varuntanmay21@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:02:50 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(agent): preserve established patient across
 affordance failures

Interaction failures (reveal/context-menu) must repair the affordance layer
instead of regressing into locate/SEARCH. Invalidate retrieval only when the
patient is contradicted or absent.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
